# Rust build output.
# NOTE: src-tauri/Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored - Rust convention is to
# commit it for applications (only libraries ignore it). It is excluded from AI
# context via .clineignore instead.
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Generated whole-repo snapshot, a checkpoint for handing work to a fresh agent.
# Excludes the vendored engine source, build output, lockfiles and the root
# parser.ts backup. Regenerate with: npx repomix .
repomix-output.xml

# Local scratch/handoff material. Useful while working, never part of the app.
# `docs/` holds screenshots, plans and test logs that are not shipped.
docs/
compacted-context.md
compacted-history.md
PROGRESS.md
